<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-EUROPEAN CUP SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-EUROPEAN CUP SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of European Cup matches</p>
<p>played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Pool A</p>
<p>In Bath: Bath (England) beat Dax (France) 25-16 (halftime</p>
<p>16-13)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Bath - Try: Henry Paul. Con: Jonathan Callard. Pens: Callard</p>
<p>(5), Mike Catt.</p>
<p>Dax - Try Ugo Mola. Con: Richard Dourthe. Pens: Dourthe (3)</p>
<p>Pool B</p>
<p>In Pau: Leicester (England) beat Pau (France) 19-14 (halftime</p>
<p>6-14)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Pau - Try: Joel Rey. Pens: David Aucagne (2). Drop-goal:</p>
<p>Aucagne.</p>
<p>Leicester - Try: Leon Lloyd. Con: Rob Liley. Pens: Liley</p>
<p>(4).</p>
<p>In Melrose: Leinster (Ireland) beat Scottish Borders 34-25</p>
<p>(halftime 22-11)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Leinster - Tries: Dean Oswald, Ciaran Clarke, Alan McGowan,</p>
<p>Denis Hickie. Cons: McGowan. Pens: McGowan (4)</p>
<p>Scottish Borders - Tries: Malcolm Changleng, Gary Parker,</p>
<p>Scott Aitken. Cons: Parker (2). Pens: Parker (2).</p>
<p>Pool C</p>
<p>In Neath: Neath (Wales) 15 Ulster (Ireland) 13 (half-time 7-6)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Neath - Tries: Steve Williams, Leighton Gerrard. Con:</p>
<p>Geraint Davies. Pen: Davies.</p>
<p>Ulster - Try: Stephen McKinty. Con: David Humphreys. Pens:</p>
<p>Humphreys (2).</p>
<p>Pool D</p>
<p>In London: Wasps (England) beat Toulouse (France) 77-17</p>
<p>(half-time 23-10)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Wasps - Tries: Andy Reed, Shane Roiser, Nick Greenstock (2),</p>
<p>Simon Mitchell, penalty try, Paul Sampson, Chris Sheasby, Alex</p>
<p>King. Cons: Jon Ufton (6), King. Pens: Ufton (5). Drop-goal:</p>
<p>King.</p>
<p>Toulouse - Tries: Emile N'tamack, Pascal Lesserre. Cons:</p>
<p>Deylaud (2). Pen: Thomas Castaignede.</p>
</text>
